WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.290
Step 1. Open the Medications tab. It opens on the Prescriptions sub-tab.

2.1
00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:12.886
Step 2. Select a prescription. Each card shows its date and its prescriber.

3.1
00:00:12.886 --> 00:00:15.453
Step 3. Read the medicines.

3.2
00:00:15.453 --> 00:00:21.444
Each row shows the dosage, frequency, duration and instructions.

4.1
00:00:21.444 --> 00:00:27.830
Step 4. Show the inactive medicines. Care hides them until you show them.

5.1
00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:34.730
Step 5. Go on to the next task. For example, select Edit or Print.
